[05:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'uh, I\'ve seen all their certifications, all their lab testing. So, I know they\'re the real deal. But, that\'s what you guys got to be really careful of here. And it\'s good to have a translator with you.'

[05:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Um, especially a knowledgeable translator like mine. This is where all the popper systems are coming from. I don\'t think any surprises there. Oh, S&amp;A chillers. Here\'s our chiller manufacturer right'

